                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Impoverished fish assemblages of temperate Neotropical streams respond to environmental degradation and support a sensitive Index of Biotic Integrity</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item" data-test="article-category">STREAM ECOLOGY</li>
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2023-04-18">18 April 2023</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
